<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria Ashaka Cement 6-month profits rise.</title>
<headline>Nigeria Ashaka Cement 6-month profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year result for Nigeria's Ashaka Cement Company Plc to end-May 1997, published on Monday. (In million naira).</p>
<p>				   1997	  1996</p>
<p> Turnover		     1,800	 1,600</p>
<p> Profit before taxation     409	   370</p>
<p> Taxation			 129	   123</p>
<p> Profit after taxation	280	   247</p>
<p>($1=84 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
